==Battleground==
*10 [[Duche]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*1 [[Squire Rel]] (100%) spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*2 [[Croakley]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 63.33~70 seconds<sup>1,900f~2,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Squire Rel]]s (4,000%) spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*12 [[Aku Doge]]s spawn after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>, delay 26.67~30 seconds<sup>800f~900f</sup>.
*5 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 53.33 seconds<sup>1,600f</sup>, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100f~1,200f</sup>.
*3 [[Aku Gory|Aku Gories]] spawn after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*15 [[Miz Devil]]s spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Croakley can permaslow all of your units, so any Uber immune to slow would work well here. Use speedy attackers like [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]], [[Slime Cat (Rare Cat)|Slime Cat]], [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] and [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Bullet Train Cat]] to take care of the Aku peons. In terms of meatshields, [[Crazed Tank Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Eraser]] and [[Crazed Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Mohawk]] work well for their fast speed, though [[Stone Cat (Rare Cat)|Boulder Cat]] also works well since it can easily stall the Aku Gories better. Slower attackers like [[Mer-Cat (Rare Cat)|Cameraman Cat]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]] and [[Teacher BearCat (Rare Cat)|Teacher BearCat]] may work, though beware of the Croakleys for obvious reasons.

